[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3315197109","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110631#issuecomment-3315197109","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110631","id":3315197109,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FmeS1","user":{"login":"precup","id":709680,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTY4MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/709680?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup","html_url":"https://github.com/precup","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-20T19:42:44Z","updated_at":"2025-09-21T02:57:13Z","body":"This is because of the addition of a separate paragraph separation property: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107331 CC @bruvzg \n\nShould the paragraph separation have defaulted to the line separation or something during the upgrade? This seems like it should at least be documented in the upgrade notes.\n\nEDIT: I just checked our project at work, which we upgraded on Thursday, and it has this problem all over the place. It's only off by 2px, so it wasn't immediately flagged, but a lot of our GUIs are misaligned.\n\nShould the paragraph spacing actually be `paragraph_separation + line_separation` instead of just `paragraph_separation`? That would be more convenient for me, at least.","author_a